  m_Name: Skirmisher
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::_Scripts.Runtime.Characters.Classes.Scripts.CombatClassSO
  defaultAttackElements: 
  _className: Skirmisher
  _defaultAttackRange: 0
  _classDescription: A fighter who focuses on speed, quick hits, and mobility instead
    of tanking damage. Think hit and run. They dart in, land a slash or two, then
    get out before the enemy can really respond.
  effects:
  - '1. While Overclocked, Nikita''s attacks are guaranteed to hit multiple times,
    with the number of hits increasing by Overclock tier.

    + (It sounds like
    both are supposed to happen)

    2. Evades attacks for several turns depending
    on Overclock tier (1-3 turns).'
  explanations:
  - '*(Explanation #1)* Higher Overclock tiers allow her to land more hits per attack,
    increasing her damage potential while complementing her fast paced, aggressive
    fighting style. Think of the Pokemon item Loaded Dice on steroids.

    + (It
    sounds like both are supposed to happen)

    *(Explanation #2)*  Dodge on command
    makes her feel more slippery as she pushes her limits.( Insert UI goku meme here) 
    But this NEEDS to played smart because you can burnout in a heart beat..'
